{"hits": {"hits": [{"created": "2026-10-30T17:49:55.388236+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-30T17:49:59.061524+00:00", "id": 23304267, "conceptrecid": "23304266", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23304267", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23304266", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23304267", "metadata": {"title": "Replication package: Integrity-Preserving Peer-to-Peer Energy Trading Under Asynchronous Negotiation in Distribution Networks", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23304267", "publication_date": "2026-10-11", "description": "<p>Code, input data, and aggregated results reproducing every table and figure of the paper: the causality-based peer-to-peer trading engine with asynchronous negotiation on the IEEE 33-bus (single-phase) and IEEE 123-bus (three-phase unbalanced) feeders, the bounded update and the rule-based dropout detector, the asynchronous consensus-ADMM baseline, the step-size and response-delay stability campaign, the threshold-sensitivity and false-positive campaigns, the feeder-end manipulation case, and the analysis scripts that compute same-set, harmed-group and residual-optimum welfare at the averaged schedule. Each table of the paper is mapped to the script and command that produce it in README.md.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Chu, Yeonouk", "affiliation": "Seoul National University"}, {"name": "Kim, Hyunjoong", "affiliation": "Hanbat National University"}, {"name": "Yoon, Yongtae", "affiliation": "Seoul National University"}], "keywords": ["peer-to-peer energy trading", "asynchronous negotiation", "distribution network", "causality-based cost allocation", "market integrity", "three-phase unbalanced power flow", "consensus ADMM"], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23304266"}}]}}, "title": "Replication package: Integrity-Preserving Peer-to-Peer Energy Tradin