"id": 23792430, "conceptrecid": "23792429", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23792430", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23792429", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23792430", "metadata": {"title": "An Auditable Evaluation Protocol for Budgeted Continuous-Integration Test Selection under Partial Feedback: Replication Package", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23792430", "publication_date": "2026-10-30", "description": "<p>This replication package accompanies the manuscript &ldquo;An Auditable Evaluation Protocol for Budgeted Continuous-Integration Test Selection under Partial Feedback.&rdquo; It contains the R6 manuscript and supplementary validation, author-created replay and analysis code, frozen protocols, a pre-outcome-locked three-project holdout, a formally frozen demand-driven reserve replay, stream-level confidence intervals and multiple-testing results, figure source data, verification records, and SHA-256 checksums. Third-party raw archives, normalized input rows, and selected test identifiers are not redistributed; source locations and retrieval information are documented in the manifests. The adaptive reserve is reported as a conditional comparator rather than a universally optimal policy.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Wang, FengQi", "affiliation": "Hubei University"}], "keywords": ["continuous integration", "software testing", "test selection", "feedback leakage", "budgeted evaluation", "empirical software engineering", "reproducibility", "EWMA", "reserve allocation"], "version": "R6", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23792429"}}]}}, "title": "An Auditable Evaluation Protocol for Budgeted Continuous-Integration Test Selection under Partial Feedback: Replication Package", "links": {