29", "description": "<p>Replication package for the paper \"When Does Prediction Pay Off? A Sensitivity Analysis of Predictive versus Reactive Autoscaling under Controlled Burst Intensity and Provisioning Delay\". It contains the Python discrete-time autoscaling simulator, the experiment configuration, analysis and plotting scripts, the raw results of all 7,600 simulation runs, summary tables and all figures. The Wikipedia request trace is not redistributed; download instructions are in README.md.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Hashim, M", "affiliation": "University of Central Punjab"}, {"name": "Moiz, Abdul", "affiliation": "University of Central Punjab"}, {"name": "Zulkifl, Hassan", "affiliation": "University of Central Punjab"}], "keywords": ["autoscaling", "Cloud computing", "Kubernetes", "Predictive autoscaling", "Simulation"], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23758239"}}]}}, "title": "When Does Prediction Pay Off? Replication Package for Predictive versus Reactive Autoscaling under Controlled Burst Intensity and Provisioning Delay", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23758240", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23758240?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23758240", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23758240", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23758240", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758239", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23758239", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23758239", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23758239", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23758240/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23758240/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23758240/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-29T18:25:08.519877+00:00", "recid": "23758240", "revision": 6, "files": [{"id": "241d818f-113c-4e43-b201-e149f55da796", "key": "zenodo_code_package.zip", "size": 1565839, "checksum": "md5:32edde13ba2cedcb3dccfb22befff830", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23758240/files/zenodo_code_package.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1974255"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 1, "unique_downloads": 1, "views": 10, "unique_views": 6, "version_downloads": 1, "version_unique_downloads": 1, "version_unique_views": 6, "version_views": 10}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-10-29T11:21:58.345375+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-29T11:21:58.630669+00:00", "id": 21702084, "conceptrecid": "21702083", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21702084", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21702083", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21702084", "metadata": {"title": "Replication package: Baggage or terrain? GDR socialisation, eastern context, and the East-West gap in AfD partisanship (SOEP 2013-2025)", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21702084", "publication_date": "2026-10-29", "description": "<p>Replication package for a single-authored article submitted to German Politics. The paper decomposes the East-West gap in AfD party identification in the German Socio-Economic Panel (SOEP-Core v42eu, waves 2013 to 2025) by the crossing of pre-1989 residence and current residence, and tests whether the eastern premium is carried by GDR socialisation, by eastern residence, or by the two together, with a generational test on cohorts born after 1989.</p>\n<p>The package contains all analysis code (Python, pure-numpy cluster-robust estimation), the dated pre-registration files whose decision rules were committed to disk before each estimation, the result records pairing each rule with its output and decision, the verbatim raw output logs to which every number in the paper traces, and the one external data file used (annual state unemployment rates from the Bundesagentur f&uuml;r Arbeit, with a provenance note). It contains no microdata. SOEP microdata are available from the SOEP Research Data Center at DIW Berlin under the standard data distribution contract (doi:10.5684/soep.core.v42eu). The pre-registration and result documents are working documents in Turkish with dated rule tables whose numerical content is legible without Turkish. See README.md for the directory structure and the reproduction workflow.</p>\n<p>Version 1.1.0 (29 October 2026) adds the re-estimation on SOEP-Core v42eu, the six additional pre-registered analyses of October 2026 (pre-move sorting probe in both directions, within-person event studies, state-by-year fixed effects and state unemployment, identifiers only, two-wave identification, household clustering) and the external unemployment series. The July 2026 material of version 1.0.0 (SOEP-Core v41eu, 2013 to 2024) is retained unchanged.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Anonymous, Anonymous", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["AfD", "radical right", "East Germany", "political socialisation", "contextual effects", "party identification", "SOEP", "panel data", "internal migration", "replication package"], "version": "1.1.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21702083"}}]}}, "title": "Replication package: Baggage or terrain? GDR socialisation, eastern context, and the East-West gap in AfD partisanship (SOEP 2013-2025)", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21702084", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21702084?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21702084", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21702084", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21702084", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702083", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21702083", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21702083", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21702083", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21702084/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21702084/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21702084/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-29T11:21:58.630669+00:00", "recid": "21702084", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "804e6c47-8afe-4a28-9c03-3718e7d6d5dc", "key": "GP_Mover_Replication_v1.1.zip", "size": 840394, "checksum": "md5:6c80adae59f143a434d1541995feed6f", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21702084/files/GP_Mover_Replication_v1.1.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1692583"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 2, "unique_downloads": 2, "views": 2, "unique_views": 1, "version_downloads": 2, "version_unique_downloads": 2, "version_unique_views": 1, "version_views": 2}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-10-28T19:25:33.546797+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-28T19:25:33.693989+00:00", "id": 23741681, "conceptrecid": "23741680", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741680", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "metadata": {"title": "From Vehicle Sales to the Fleet: Road Transport Electrification in Colombia \u2014 GAMS Model and Replication Data", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "publication_date": "2026-10-28", "description": "<p>Reproducibility archive for the study \"From Vehicle Sales to the Fleet: Energy and Macroeconomic Effects of Road Transport Electrification Policies in Colombia\".</p>\n<p>This repository contains a recursive-dynamic computable general equilibrium (CGE) model integrated with a vehicle technology-choice and fleet-turnover module for Colombia. The model is calibrated to a 2024 social accounting matrix and simulates the period 2025&ndash;2048.</p>\n<p>The replication package includes the GAMS model, calibration data, six policy scenarios (E0&ndash;E5), 15 sensitivity experiments (S01&ndash;S15), simulation results, solver diagnostics, and a mathematical specification of the CGE model in English.</p>\n<p>The repository also provides a Python postprocessing script to reconstruct physical road transport energy consumption separately from the monetary energy valuation used within the CGE model.</p>\n<p>The simulations were executed using GAMS 53.5.1 and CONOPT. Reproducing the model requires a valid GAMS installation and license. All central scenarios and sensitivity experiments can be executed from the main run.gms file.</p>\n<p>The original model code is distributed under the MIT License, while the data, simulation results, and documentation are distributed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Rodriguez Avila, Jesus Eduardo", "affiliation": "Universidad EAFIT", "orcid": "0009-0005-5714-6419"}, {"name": "Botero Garc\u00eda, Jes\u00fas Alonso", "affiliation": "Comestibles DAN", "orcid": "0000-0001-9821-7221"}, {"name": "Hurtado Rendon, Alvaro Arturo", "affiliation": "Universidad EAFIT", "orcid": "0000-0002-6973-1966"}, {"name": "Osorio-G\u00f3mez, Gilberto", "affiliation": "Universidad EAFIT", "orcid": "0000-0002-8760-3335"}, {"name": "Giraldo Galindo, Michael Daniel", "affiliation": "Universidad EAFIT", "orcid": "0000-0002-4967-4909"}], "keywords": ["Transport electrification", "Computable general equilibrium", "Vehicle fleet turnover", "Electric vehicles", "Energy demand", "Colombia", "GAMS"], "version": "1.0.0.", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "gams", "title": {"en": "GAMS"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23741680"}}]}}, "title": "From Vehicle Sales to the Fleet: Road Transport Electrification in Colombia \u2014 GAMS Model and Replication Data", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23741681", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23741681?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741680", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23741680", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23741680", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23741680", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23741681/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23741681/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23741681/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-28T19:25:33.693989+00:00", "recid": "23741681", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "58e426ec-5d64-4fd8-b009-202fd42089cb", "key": "Road_Transport_Electrification_Colombia.zip", "size": 2559597, "checksum": "md5:711c663ea24c32ea22a97c0000b637f3", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/files/Road_Transport_Electrification_Colombia.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1972644"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 3, "unique_downloads": 3, "views": 3, "unique_views": 3, "version_downloads": 3, "version_unique_downloads": 3, "version_unique_views": 3, "version_views": 3}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-10-28T19:17:21.392078+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-28T19:17:21.728518+00:00", "id": 23741826, "conceptrecid": "23741825", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741826", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741825", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23741826", "metadata": {"title": "Replication package: Change Relevance, Not Description Semantics. A large-scale empirical evaluation of semantic test case prioritisation on real continuous integration data", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741826", "publication_date": "2026-10-28", "description": "<p>Replication package for S. Ndlovu, E. Mnkandla and M. Ramachandran, \"Change Relevance, Not Description Semantics: A Large-Scale Empirical Evaluation of Semantic Test Case Prioritisation on Real Continuous Integration Data\" (manuscript). The study evaluates logistic regression, a random forest and the CIOM convolutional network on real CI data, with and without a description-based semantic score and BM25 change relevance, over three seeds and two evaluation protocols, and uses identity controls to separate the meaning of the semantic score from its ability to identify individual tests.</p>\n<p>The archive contains the experiment harness (train_evaluate_p2.py, with the feature configurations and identity controls), the lists of every run, the analysis scripts, the per-cycle scores and run manifest of every run, and the analysis outputs behind Tables 2-7 and Figure 1 of the paper. The study uses the CIOM-CI dataset, which is archived separately and is not included here: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23478324. See README.md and README_paper2.md (inside the zip) for the folder layout and commands. Code is released under the MIT licence; results files under CC BY 4.0.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Ndlovu, Siqabukile", "affiliation": "National University of Science and Technology"}, {"name": "Mnkandla, Ernest", "affiliation": "University of South Africa"}, {"name": "Ramachandran, Muthu", "affiliation": "University of South Africa"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.23478324", "relation": "requires", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1145/3395363.3397383", "relation": "isDerivedFrom", "resource_type": "publication-conferencepaper", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1002/stvr.1864", "relation": "isDerivedFrom", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}], "version": "1.0", "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23741825"}}]}}, "title": "Repl