 "<p>This package contains the code, input data and analysed simulation results needed to reproduce the figures of the paper: Fig. 1, Fig. 2, Additional Figs. 1&ndash;4 and the supplementary figure on the stratospheric aerosol injection (SAI) climate efficacy angle.</p>\n<p>The analysis compares the cost of offsetting the warming from a CH\u2084 or CO\u2082 emission pulse with SAI against the cost of abating the emissions directly. It samples the uncertain climate, economic and SAI parameters with a scrambled Sobol sequence, runs G-FAIR (a GAMS implementation of the FaIR climate model) once per draw and gas, and prices the resulting climate damages, SAI side effects and air-pollution impacts.</p>\n<p>The package includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>the G-FAIR model, the SAI experiment and the RCP inputs;</li>\n<li>the R scripts for sampling, running and analysing the Monte Carlo simulations, with every distribution and setting in a single control file (<code>Paper_SAI/all_parameters.R</code>);</li>\n<li>the analysed results of the simulations behind the paper (main sample of 8,192 draws; base sample of 1,024 draws &times; 2 pulse years, with the SAI angle uncertain, fixed at 10&deg; and fixed at 30&deg;);</li>\n<li>the CH\u2084 abatement cost curves used in Fig. 2, from Harmsen et al. (2019) and the IEA Global Methane Tracker 2026;</li>\n<li>the figures as PDF and PNG.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The raw model output (.gdx files) is not included: running the full pipeline regenerates it.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Andreoni, Pietro", "affiliation": "Politecnico di Milano", "orcid": "0000-0003-2487-1671"}], "version": "v1.0", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/PietroAndreoni/G-FAIR", "code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "r", "title": {"en": "R"}}, {"id": "gams", "title": {"en": "GAMS"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "journal": {"title": "Nature climate change"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23735562"}}]}}, "title": "Replication package for \"Solar geoengineering to offset short lived greenhouse gases\"", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23735563", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23735563?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23735563", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23735563", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23735563", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735562", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23735562", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23735562", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23735562", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23735563/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23735563/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23735563/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-28T17:06:22.401993+00:00", "recid": "23735563", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "f9906f71-e6f9-4acf-bba3-8f1fe9714e25", "key": "Replication_package.zip", "size": 41547456, "checksum": "md5:f13e242b7c976ac91ee909c74edf529a", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/files/Replication_package.zip/content"}}, {"id": "1941ac2a-fe7f-463a-bd3e-5f9d75fc328b", "key": "README.md", "size": 15559, "checksum": "md5:1524fdb595aa218bbcfefc1b94b3d138", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23735563/files/README.md/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "340079"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 4, "unique_downloads": 4, "views": 4, "unique_views": 4, "version_downloads": 4, "version_unique_downloads": 4, "version_unique_views": 4, "version_views": 4}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-10-28T15:36:21.267649+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-28T15:36:21.530246+00:00", "id": 23568911, "conceptrecid": "23568910", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23568911", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23568910", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23568911", "metadata": {"title": "Replication Package for \"Uncentered Bootstrap t-Statistics Explain the Missing Time Series Momentum in Huang, Li, Wang, and Zhou (2020)\"", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23568911", "publication_date": "2026-10-28", "description": "<p>Replication package for Laura Capera Romero and Aleksi Pitk&auml;j&auml;rvi, \"Uncentered Bootstrap <em>t</em>-Statistics Explain the Missing Time Series Momentum in Huang, Li, Wang, and Zhou (2020)\", Critical Finance Review (forthcoming).</p>\n<p>The package contains the MATLAB code that produces every table and figure in the paper and its Internet Appendix, together with the output of a full run (bootstrap draws, tables and figures). It includes the parts of the code of Huang, Li, Wang, and Zhou (2020) that the analysis uses, some of them modified as documented in the README.</p>\n<p>The data are not included. The only input is Return.mat from the replication package of Huang, Li, Wang, and Zhou (2020), \"Time series momentum: Is it there?\", Journal of Financial Economics 135(3), 774-794, available from Guofu Zhou's website (https://guofuzhou.github.io/Data_and_Matlab_code.zip). README.txt explains how to combine the two downloads and gives SHA-256 checksums; the code verifies the data file before running.</p>\n<p>Requirements: MATLAB R2021a or newer with the Statistics and Machine Learning Toolbox and the Parallel Computing Toolbox.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Capera Romero, Laura", "affiliation": "Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam", "orcid": "0000-0001-5324-4146"}, {"name": "Pitk\u00e4j\u00e4rvi, Aleksi", "affiliation": "Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam", "orcid": "0009-0002-5598-7685"}], "keywords": ["time series momentum", "time series predictability", "bootstrapping", "pooled panel regression"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1016/j.jfineco.2019.08.004", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "https://guofuzhou.github.io/Data_and_Matlab_code.zip", "relation": "requires", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "1.0.0", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "matlab", "title": {"en": "MATLAB"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23568910"}}]}}, "title": "Replication Package for \"Uncentered Bootstrap t-Statistics Explain the Missing Time Series Momentum in Huang, Li, Wang, and Zhou (2020)\"", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23568911", "self_html": "ht