"23568911", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "e2e25dd8-1a1a-4c6d-a359-66ac57255bda", "key": "uncentered-bootstrap-tsmom-replication.zip", "size": 6251066, "checksum": "md5:182788a7c19c9f50b8d0dcaba4f1bbdc", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23568911/files/uncentered-bootstrap-tsmom-replication.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1958699"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 9, "unique_downloads": 9, "views": 11, "unique_views": 6, "version_downloads": 9, "version_unique_downloads": 9, "version_unique_views": 6, "version_views": 11}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-10-28T15:33:30.427711+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-28T15:33:30.699357+00:00", "id": 23717327, "conceptrecid": "23717326", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23717327", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23717326", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23717327", "metadata": {"title": "Replication package for: \"Observational price variation in scanner data does not reproduce experimental price elasticities\"", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23717327", "publication_date": "2026-10-28", "description": "<p>Stamatopoulos, Ioannis, Robert L. Bray, and Robert Evan Sanders (2026). &ldquo;Observational price variation in scanner data does not reproduce experimental price elasticities.&rdquo; Econometrica, conditionally accepted.</p>\n<p>Authors&rsquo; names are listed in random order.</p>\n<p>This replication package contains the analysis code, publicly released elasticity estimates, replication instructions, and figures, tables, and statistics for the paper and online appendix. The public replication starts from the shared elasticity estimates. The confidential raw data are not included.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Stamatopoulos, Ioannis", "affiliation": "The University of Texas at Austin", "orcid": "0000-0002-3651-0788"}, {"name": "Bray, Robert", "affiliation": "Kellogg School of Management", "orcid": "0000-0003-2773-0663"}, {"name": "Sanders, R